  "summary": "Clarify the Small Shop domain-history boundary.",
  "why": "The executable showcase proves a domain graph model and one fixture-specific state-versioning encoding over Core's generic history laws. Calling its first change genesis without explaining the positional meaning could imply a formal seed role or a selected domain ledger vocabulary that does not exist. This forward clarification keeps the published runtime evidence unchanged while stating exactly what Core supplies and what adopters still choose."
